# Rice MMKG - Rice Multimodal Knowledge Graph
#
# https://w3id.org/ricemmkg is the namespace of Rice MMKG, an OWL 2 ontology
# and knowledge graph for rice disease and pest diagnosis.
#
# Terms are hash IRIs, e.g. https://w3id.org/ricemmkg#Rice_Blast_Disease.
# The fragment is never sent to the server, so every term IRI resolves
# through the root rules below.
#
# https://w3id.org/ricemmkg            browsers     -> GitHub repository
#                                      RDF clients  -> latest ontology (RDF/XML)
# https://w3id.org/ricemmkg/<version>  any client   -> ontology at git tag v<version>
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Muhammad Ariful Furqon
# GitHub username: Ariful-Furqon

Options -MultiViews

RewriteEngine on

# Version IRIs, e.g. https://w3id.org/ricemmkg/0.6.1
# -> the ontology file as released under git tag v0.6.1.
# "\%20" is a literal %20 (the file name contains a space); NE stops Apache
# from re-escaping it to %2520.
RewriteRule ^([0-9]+\.[0-9]+(\.[0-9]+)?)/?$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ariful-Furqon/Rice-Multimodal-Knowledge-Graph/v$1/Ontology/Rice\%20MMKG.rdf [R=303,L,NE]

# Browsers -> repository page (to be switched to the HTML documentation
# once it is published)
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} !application/rdf\+xml.*(text/html|application/xhtml\+xml)
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^$ https://github.com/Ariful-Furqon/Rice-Multimodal-Knowledge-Graph [R=303,L]

# Everything else at the root (application/rdf+xml, */*, no Accept header)
# -> latest ontology, RDF/XML
RewriteRule ^$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ariful-Furqon/Rice-Multimodal-Knowledge-Graph/main/Ontology/Rice\%20MMKG.rdf [R=303,L,NE]
